ADM --> UC_LitDisponible
ADM --> UC_BlocAdmission
ADM --> UC_TauxOccupation
FACT --> UC_Valoriser
FACT --> UC_EmettreActe
FACT --> UC_SuspendreFacturation
FACT --> UC_FigerGrille
